    </p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>
      <b>17 out of 26 cells on the path get visited 2+ times in an 80-turn game.</b> Two-thirds of the ship's hex-path is multi-occupancy. <b>Same-cell-hit-twice is the default, not the exception.</b>
    </p>
  </li>
